// starfall — en. Keys: modules/rts/RtsLocalize.h; how-to keys: engine/ui docs.
{
  "@language": "English",

  // how to play (UI: "How to play" screen)
  "howto.like": "StarCraft II: three races, each with its own way to build.",
  "howto.goal": "Destroy every enemy building.",
  "howto.tip": "Stalker and zealot shields recharge after 10 seconds without damage — pull wounded units back.",
  "howto.step1": "One worker mines a patch at a time, 5 minerals a trip; gas is 4 a trip from an assimilator, extractor or refinery.",
  "howto.step2": "Guild: probes start a structure and walk on; structures work only in a pylon field. Swarm: drones become structures, up to 3 larva per hatchery, everything on creep.",
  "howto.step3": "Legion: SCVs build; barracks and factory take add-ons — a tech lab (marauders, siege tanks) or a reactor (two marines at once).",
  "howto.step4": "Damage = attack + bonus vs armored or light − armor. Low ground can't see up the plateau. Queens inject 3 extra larvae into a hatchery; a nexus chrono-boosts production and recalls the army home."
